{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15109090","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15109090","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:5:1510909001:1":{"text":"The sky is turning red... Is the Blood Moon returning?","source_cn":"天空变红了……血月又要来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC65B12F8B50A7ADB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510909002:1":{"text":"Modra didn't foresee this...","source_cn":"蒙多没有卜算到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBBC75930C9F6860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510909003:0":{"text":"The Blood Moon is usually a good omen, but something feels different...","source_cn":"血月来了，应该是吉兆。但是，感觉不一样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8B6EB5E2756F79F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510909004:0":{"text":"The Blood Moon is also the symbol of the Hunting Goddess. If the crystal responded to it, she may already be <style=\"highlight\">descending onto the battlefield</style>.","source_cn":"血月也是狩猎神象征。她很可能要<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA24FDF5D68AA572","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510909005:0":{"text":"We have to <style=\"highlight\">catch up to Perseus</style> as soon as possible. If we can't stop the war, Halia will inevitably fall!","source_cn":"我们得尽快<style=highlight>追上珀尔修...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8270C6EE4269B5B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510909006:0":{"text":"Then I'm coming with you.","source_cn":"我和你们一起去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34F0C6CB96B0D9E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510909007:1":{"text":"Really? Both sides want your head on a spear.","source_cn":"你去干什么？双方的刀都会瞄准你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63BED4BE7D66054F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510909008:1":{"text":"I remember what you promised me. You'd <style=\"highlight\">kill the Hunting Goddess</style>.","source_cn":"少废话。你们答应过，要<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE28E42B30A2A138","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510909009:1":{"text":"Ah. Right. That whole \"slay-a-god\" thing.","source_cn":"哦，差点忘了，你是个想弑神的“信徒”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32446D8752E58063","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510909010:0":{"text":"Well, come on then. Just try not to die before you're useful.","source_cn":"可以，来吧。你至少能帮我们挡几刀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAB0A5D2C1C956B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510909011:0":{"text":"Nazrik, you—why are you doing this?!","source_cn":"那非，你、你为什么……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAC98B441D241D60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510909012:1":{"text":"Gala... If you want to protect <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, then think carefully about what a god truly is.","source_cn":"加拉，如果你想保护<style=stress><pla...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB2DC504EFEB8CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Gala... If you want to protect <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, then think carefully about what a god truly is.","female":"Gala... If you want to protect <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, then think carefully about what a god truly is.","variant_male_record_index":"175277","variant_female_record_index":"175278","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510909013:1":{"text":"And what it will take to stop such a violent one.","source_cn":"以及，怎么做才能阻止那残暴的神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81DE3C8BF02970BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1510909014:1":{"text":"You won't get many more chances. She nearly killed you.","source_cn":"你没有多少机会，因为她差点就杀死了你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6627B89C3082CD62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1510909015:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog71>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x211F7AC2CA3C9A12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:25:150109152:0":{"text":"Red mist fills the air as the Blood Moon rises. It's time to confront Azora.","source_cn":"红雾弥漫，血月已至。是时候迎战狩猎神了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB14250725E636A13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:那非":{"text":"Nazrik","source":"那非","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"Gala","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"Merlin the First","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:摩根":{"text":"Morgan","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":5}}